{%- comment -%}
  Product card — a line of text the merchant writes or binds.

  **One block for every fixed thing a card says.** It replaced two — a
  metafield-only caption line and a tax note that carried its own copy — which
  were the same element with different words, one of them with a jeweller's
  vocabulary built in.

  Three uses, all the same block:

    - a fact about the piece — connect the text to a product metafield with the
      dynamic-source button and it prints whatever that shop keeps there;
    - a separator — a `·` between two other blocks inside a `group`, which is
      how "White Gold · 1.5 ct" is composed rather than assembled in Liquid;
    - an aside beside the price.

  **The text is a dynamic source, not a metafield picker.** Shopify has no
  metafield setting type for a block schema; what it has is the dynamic-source
  connector on a `text` setting. The Product source inherits
  `closest.product` inside a card and can be chosen directly elsewhere, so the
  same metafield connection survives either composition.

  **Preset and element are two settings, because they are two questions.** The
  preset is a look from Theme settings → Typography; the element is what the
  thing is in the page's outline, which is an SEO decision. Block-level font,
  size, colour, line height, case, and letter-spacing controls are explicit
  overrides and otherwise inherit the selected preset.

  **The row is held whether or not there is a word in it.** `.card__meta`
  carries `min-height: 1.5em` and always has: it is what keeps a row of cards
  level when one piece has a caption and its neighbour does not, and why a block
  bound to a metafield some product lacks shows as an empty line rather than
  collapsing.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign value = block.settings.text | strip

  comment
    A guard rather than interpolating whatever is stored: an unknown value would
    print as a tag name and Liquid would happily emit `<foo>`. Same shape as the
    level guard on `blocks/title.liquid`.
  endcomment
  assign tags = 'span,p,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6' | split: ','
  assign tag = 'span'
  if tags contains block.settings.element
    assign tag = block.settings.element
  endif
-%}

<{{ tag }}
  class="card__meta card__text"
  style="{% render 'text-style', preset: block.settings.style, font_style: block.settings.override_font, font_size: block.settings.override_size, color: block.settings.color, line_height: block.settings.override_leading, text_case: block.settings.override_case, letter_spacing: block.settings.override_tracking %}"
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>{{ value }}</{{ tag }}>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:blocks.product_card_text.name",
  "tag": null,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:blocks.all.content_source_header"
    },
    {
      "type": "product",
      "id": "product",
      "label": "t:blocks.all.product_source.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.all.product_source.info"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "text",
      "label": "t:blocks.product_card_text.text.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.product_card_text.text.info"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:blocks.all.text_header"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "style",
      "label": "t:blocks.all.text_preset.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.all.text_preset.info",
      "options": [
        { "value": "title", "label": "t:settings_schema.typography.presets.title.header" },
        { "value": "heading_1", "label": "t:settings_schema.typography.presets.heading_1.header" },
        { "value": "heading_2", "label": "t:settings_schema.typography.presets.heading_2.header" },
        { "value": "heading_3", "label": "t:settings_schema.typography.presets.heading_3.header" },
        { "value": "heading_4", "label": "t:settings_schema.typography.presets.heading_4.header" },
        { "value": "heading_5", "label": "t:settings_schema.typography.presets.heading_5.header" },
        { "value": "subheading", "label": "t:settings_schema.typography.presets.subheading.header" },
        { "value": "paragraph", "label": "t:settings_schema.typography.presets.paragraph.header" },
        { "value": "small", "label": "t:settings_schema.typography.presets.small.header" },
        { "value": "caption", "label": "t:settings_schema.typography.presets.caption.header" }
      ],
      "default": "caption"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "element",
      "label": "t:blocks.all.text_element.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.all.text_element.info",
      "options": [
        { "value": "span", "label": "t:blocks.all.text_element.span" },
        { "value": "p", "label": "t:blocks.all.text_element.p" },
        { "value": "h1", "label": "t:blocks.all.text_element.h1" },
        { "value": "h2", "label": "t:blocks.all.text_element.h2" },
        { "value": "h3", "label": "t:blocks.all.text_element.h3" },
        { "value": "h4", "label": "t:blocks.all.text_element.h4" },
        { "value": "h5", "label": "t:blocks.all.text_element.h5" },
        { "value": "h6", "label": "t:blocks.all.text_element.h6" }
      ],
      "default": "span"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:blocks.all.override_header"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "override_font",
      "label": "t:blocks.all.override_font.label",
      "options": [
        { "value": "inherit", "label": "t:blocks.all.inherit.label" },
        { "value": "accent", "label": "t:settings_schema.typography.roles.accent" },
        { "value": "body", "label": "t:settings_schema.typography.roles.body" },
        { "value": "subheading", "label": "t:settings_schema.typography.roles.subheading" },
        { "value": "heading", "label": "t:settings_schema.typography.roles.heading" }
      ],
      "default": "inherit"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "override_size",
      "label": "t:blocks.all.override_size.label",
      "options": [
        { "value": "inherit", "label": "t:blocks.all.inherit.label" },
        { "value": "3xs", "label": "t:settings_schema.typography.scale.3xs" },
        { "value": "2xs", "label": "t:settings_schema.typography.scale.2xs" },
        { "value": "xs", "label": "t:settings_schema.typography.scale.xs" },
        { "value": "sm", "label": "t:settings_schema.typography.scale.sm" },
        { "value": "md", "label": "t:settings_schema.typography.scale.md" },
        { "value": "lg", "label": "t:settings_schema.typography.scale.lg" },
        { "value": "xl", "label": "t:settings_schema.typography.scale.xl" },
        { "value": "2xl", "label": "t:settings_schema.typography.scale.2xl" },
        { "value": "3xl", "label": "t:settings_schema.typography.scale.3xl" },
        { "value": "4xl", "label": "t:settings_schema.typography.scale.4xl" },
        { "value": "5xl", "label": "t:settings_schema.typography.scale.5xl" },
        { "value": "6xl", "label": "t:settings_schema.typography.scale.6xl" },
        { "value": "7xl", "label": "t:settings_schema.typography.scale.7xl" },
        { "value": "8xl", "label": "t:settings_schema.typography.scale.8xl" }
      ],
      "default": "inherit"
    },
    {
